OnCalendar=Mon..Fri 2026-10-12..30 12:05:00 America/New_York
OnCalendar=Mon..Fri 2026-10-12..30 13:05:00 America/New_York
OnCalendar=Mon..Fri 2026-10-12..30 14:05:00 America/New_York
OnCalendar=Mon..Fri 2026-10-12..30 15:05:00 America/New_York
